{"id":"n64527-1-9","stage":3,"title":"다가가다 · 走近","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64527-1-9-1","ko":"여기 앉으면 사진에 나오나요?","zh":"坐在这里的话会出现在照片里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"앉으면","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉으면","audio":"/audio/1b09080ee782dd02f48d.mp3"}},{"text":"사진에","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진에","audio":"/audio/31472a00a670985bb90c.mp3"}},{"text":"나오나요?","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오나요","audio":"/audio/17d235eb30aa2dfd61d2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/67ca1bee512e41ade05d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64527-1-9-2","ko":"아니요, 옆 사람한테 더 바짝 다가가서 앉으세요.","zh":"不会，您要往旁边的人那边再靠近些坐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"옆","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}},{"text":"사람한테","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람한테","audio":"/audio/cfa9073a06cf6c466b47.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"바짝","meaning":"猛然，骤然","explanation":"바짝：猛然，骤然","readings":[{"term":"바짝","audio":"/audio/42892c441b42f0e17948.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58055","senseId":"3","lemma":"바짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바짝","audio":"/audio/42892c441b42f0e17948.mp3"}},{"text":"다가가서","meaning":"走近，接近","explanation":"다가가다：走近，接近；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"